# Osseous Sticktwister's delirium trigger (CR 207.2c, 603.4, 700.2): on turn 1 Black Lotus, Mox Jet and Mox Ruby pay for the
# Sticktwister ({1}{B}) and a Wheel of Fortune ({2}{R}). The Wheel puts a Memnite (artifact creature), an Island (land), the
# Wheel (sorcery) and the Lotus (artifact) into Bot1's graveyard: four card types. At Bot1's end step Bot2, holding seven new
# cards but no permanent, may discard a card or do neither, and does neither: the Sticktwister deals 2 (its power) to Bot2
# (20 -> 18) and, having lifelink, Bot1 gains 2 (20 -> 22).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Osseous Sticktwister
Wheel of Fortune
Memnite
Island
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x7
